sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Пользователь
    participant W as Экран
    participant B as TasksBloc
    participant UC as AddTaskUseCase
    participant R as TasksRepositoryImpl
    participant DS as RemoteDataSource
    participant API as TasksApi + HTTP-клиент
    participant S as Сервер
    U->>W: «Купить молоко», «Добавить»
    W->>B: add(TaskAddRequested)
    B-->>W: status = adding
    B->>UC: call(text)
    Note over UC: trim, не пустое, ≤ 100 символов
    UC->>R: addTask(title)
    R->>DS: createTask(CreateTaskRequestDto)
    DS->>API: createTask({title})
    API->>S: POST /v1/tasks (+ токен)
    S-->>API: 201 JSON
    API-->>DS: Map
    DS-->>R: TaskDto
    R-->>UC: Task (toEntity)
    UC-->>B: Success(task)
    B-->>W: status = ready, tasks + task
    W-->>U: задача в списке
